  "body": "A truly rare find in Long Bay - a brand-new luxury home where all three levels enjoy sea views, paired with an exceptionally large, beautifully proportioned backyard. Set on a 499m2 site and offering approximately 334m2 of floor area, this is the kind of combination that is increasingly hard to find in Long Bay: space, views, flexibility and a backyard the whole family can actually enjoy.\r\n\r\nDesigned across three impressive levels, the layout has been carefully considered for modern family living and multi-generational flexibility.\r\n\r\nGround Level\r\nA private bedroom suite sits alongside the heart of the home - expansive open-plan living and dining, a beautifully appointed kitchen and scullery, all designed to make everyday living and entertaining effortless.\r\n\r\nBasement Level\r\nDownstairs feels like a retreat of its own. Here you will find another bedroom, bathroom, a spacious second living area and bar, with excellent indoor-outdoor connection and its own access to the deck and backyard. Use the living space as a media room, home gym, games room or relaxed family lounge - the choice is yours.\r\n\r\nFor families with parents or grandparents staying long term, this level offers a wonderful degree of separation, privacy and comfort.\r\n\r\nFirst Level\r\nUpstairs are three further bedrooms, including the main master suite with ensuite and walk-in wardrobe, plus a family bathroom and a delightful sitting/study nook. Imagine starting your morning here with a coffee and a book, looking out towards the sea - or simply sitting quietly at the end of the day and watching the view.\r\n\r\nCrafted by renowned local builder Longbay Homes, this home is about more than size - it is about the details. Thoughtful proportions, a clear and practical flow between spaces, quality finishes, Miele appliances and Kohler tapware come together to create a home designed for those who genuinely appreciate how they live.\r\nAnd then there is the backyard.\r\n\r\nLarge, beautifully proportioned and full of possibility, it is a genuine luxury for a modern Long Bay home. Picture a future swimming pool or heated spa, a trampoline and playground creating the ultimate kids' zone, landscaped gardens for summer entertaining, or your own vegetable and flower gardens. Keep the generous lawn\r\nexactly as it is, or create something entirely your own - this is a backyard that gives you options rather than compromises.\r\n\r\nWith approximately 334m2 of living across three levels, five bedrooms, multiple living zones, double garaging, sea views and that extraordinary backyard, 10 Humenga Place is not simply another new build. It is a home created for family, entertaining and the lifestyle that brought you to Long Bay in the first place.\r\n\r\nHomes offering this combination of sea views, scale and usable outdoor space are exceptionally hard to find in Long Bay.\r\n\r\nContact us today to experience 10 Humenga Place for yourself - your next chapter by the sea could start right here.",
